  "$comment": "Small need cards (vertical slice design §8, W5). A card rises from the real world — a resident object's wear, rain, a season, the owner's own state or turn — and is solved the owner's own way (self), with a neighbour (pair) or with the player (player). bands: when it may rise and be solved; cooldownLifeDays: how long it rests after; archetype·spot: what the owner does to solve it (pair.spot when the pair solves it elsewhere; moves overrides the archetype's object move; until: a solving that runs past bedtime, minutes after the life day starts — R4's 02:30; excites: the owner's glad next day (excited-find); pair.glad: what the owner does more gladly after the two solved it (pair-glad); player.spot: where a take holds the owner when the card's own spot is out in the open). Thresholds and rests were retuned by the simulation on 2026-10-25 (C1·C5·W6·R3 rest longer, the leaf jar, the support and the tools wear slower) so the cards together stay near three a day and a passing moment still finds room. pair: the neighbour who joins (partnerArchetype at partnerSpot, in the owner's place) and the pair scene that draws it (null = chat). player: the choices a player makes in 「나와 함께」, its relation role, who else it holds, ready false when its scene is a later bundle's (C5·R6 the tea order, W8). trace: the world field a solving leaves; news: its rank in the village news (1 a visible trace, 2 a new tea, 3 an agreement; null = never news; newsPaths limits it). trigger kinds: wear (the object's uses reach threshold), rain-start (raining while the object is outside), rain-stop (rain ended within cards.rainStopWindowMinutes), after-rain (the band starts clear after a rainy band, the object outside), state (the owner's stat below/atLeast, clear: only in clear weather, allNighter: only the day after a night of R4), count (the archetype's count today reaches min), night-clear, season-leaf (autumn: the morning after rain; other seasons a seeded third of days), after (new-tool: the morning after the worn tool was replaced at threshold), rush (a cafe rush of cards.rushGuests within cards.rushWindowMinutes), first-visit (C4, locked until W9). 〔초기값〕",
